# jemdoc: title{News | Sehyun Kwon}
= News

- *09.2026:* I joined Hanyang University ERICA as an Assistant Professor. I am excited and grateful to begin this new chapter.
- *08.2026:* I left Samsung Research. I am grateful to have learned so much while working with amazing colleagues and deploying AI models on the Galaxy S26.
- *07.2026:* I will attend ICML 2026. I am grateful to have been nominated as a Gold Reviewer and to have received free registration.
